<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see mostly sunny skies.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see mostly sunny skies.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Thursday were forecast to see mostly sunny skies, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see highs of 22 to 26 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see a mix of sun and cloud, with showers in the north, and highs of 20 to 28 C.</p>
<p>Manitoba should get highs of 28 to 30 C.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
